      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robinette%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Robinette sits at an elevation of approximately nine hundred thirty-nine feet above sea level in the hilly Appalachian landscape.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18,
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/robinette_west_virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Dense forests typical of the Appalachian Mountains cover the region, preserving much of the natural topography around Robinette.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
